                                        "entry_id": "139a540f-6414-370b-a209-a7bd30aa72da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "in a witting manner, intentionally, on purpose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6faef2e9-529a-4934-8143-e11766ab1602",
                                                "sense_id": "be5bdd1c-27d8-3f3d-a9ce-12df7d39ceed",
                                                "text": "It muſt be ſo offended, it cannot be els, for heere lyes the poynt, if I drowne my ſelfe wittingly, it argues an act, & an act hath three branches, it is to act, to doe, to performe, or all; ſhe drownd her ſelfe wittingly."
